{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucha Masters: Mighty Lucha</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re about to tell you a story of adventure, betrayal, friendship... and tacos. Just like any good Mexican telenovela.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8a5d305668b657e4bb8d7a496672ae1b.poster.avif?t=1761437402\" width=619 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8a5d305668b657e4bb8d7a496672ae1b.webm?t=1761437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action game where up to 4 players can dive into frenetic battles thanks to amazing gameplay, memorable characters, and retro 8-bit aesthetics.<br>Inspired by authentic Mexican legends and myths, the music, colors, enemies, and levels will make you vibrate with a unique atmosphere full of Lucha Libre. It\u2019s time to become a true luchador!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside <strong>Lucho</strong>, a small axolotl with a big mission: defeat the evil <strong>IRONMOL-cajete</strong>, break pi\u00f1atas, eat tacos... and get fit! (Although, let\u2019s be honest, that last one is the hardest part).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/83961cf412a446f232d4a29ba14504ff.apng?t=1761437402\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/83961cf412a446f232d4a29ba14504ff.poster.avif?t=1761437402\" class=\"bb_img\" width=619 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on great adventures solo or in co-op mode, crossing through various colorful places until you face the evil <strong>IRONMOL-cajete</strong> (It\u2019s a robot with AI that turned pi\u00f1atas evil! Can you imagine that? An evil pi\u00f1ata? How sad\u2026).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're tired of that sadness, fix it by hitting your friend with a chair or many other things! (We say it in the game, not in real life). In <strong>Lucha Mode</strong>, up to 4 players can grab and beat each other uncontrollably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.poster.avif?t=1761437402\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.webm?t=1761437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/9d60bf4ea9a9bc500f7c4c22acd0072c.mp4?t=1761437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face evil, create a revolution, overthrow the system, eat tons of tacos, have fun, and become a LEGEND. Never forget that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.poster.avif?t=1761437402\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.webm?t=1761437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857170/extras/8b7d4f2959eb00583c6aeda7e233a314.mp4?t=1761437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstati